{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16","cat":"counsel","group":{"id":"char5041","label":"Scarlet"},"label":"Advising Scarlet: 16","stage":null,"prev":"d_counseling_hongryeon_15","next":"d_counseling_hongryeon_17","speakers":{"hongryeon":"Scarlet"},"icons":{"hongryeon":"si_c222_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_16_1","text":"My good fellow, what are your views on romance?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom","bgArt":"commanderroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_backtonormal","movie":null,"shown":["hongryeon"],"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_16_2","text":"Given the sad state of our world, is it something we must have?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_16_3","text":"Or does it not have a place in the world as it is?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_4","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_16_4","text":"As soon as you start overanalyzing it, any romance ceases to exist.","jump":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_6","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_120"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_5","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_16_5","text":"I think you could make a case for both.","jump":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_10","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_100"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_16_6","text":"I see.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_16_7","text":"I cannot deny the truth in your words.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_16_8","text":"The moment one begins to ponder such matters, they are drained of any semblance of romance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_16_9","text":"Well then, let us drink to romance on this day.","jump":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_13","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_16_10","text":"Haha, you would not perchance be reticent on siding with either argument, would you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_16_11","text":"In an ideal world, perhaps you could get by with such a vague answer.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_16_12","text":"It is, however, not suitable for a world in which thy life is constantly in peril.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_16_13","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_16_13","text":"Scarlet and I debate the meaning of romance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"}]}